    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of the picturesque Sunny Beach summer camp, a story full of warmth, nostalgia and first sincere feelings unfolds. You play as Ulyana, a young and energetic counselor who happily returns to the camp every year to give visitors unforgettable memories. But this time things will be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate brings Ulyana together with a new counselor - mysterious and a little reserved Nikita. With every moment of the relationship between them begins to skip a spark, which gradually ignites into something more. \ud83d\udc95</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a story-driven visual novel, the main task of which is to read the text and go through all the cutscenes.</p>",
